### `AsyncFunction`

Similarly to the [`AsyncFunction`](/modules/module-api.md#asyncfunction) inside the module definition, you can define functions attached to the view ref to allow direct modification of the native view.

View async functions will always be dispatched on the main queue and can receive the view instance as the first argument.

```swift
View(MyView.self) {
